th":64,"height":36}]},{"text":"망은 라디오 스펙트럼을 이용한다고 했다. 여기서는 인터넷에서 공통적으로 사용하는","words":[{"text":"망은","x":171,"y":976,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"라디오","x":252,"y":977,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"스펙트럼을","x":364,"y":977,"width":168,"height":37},{"text":"이용한다고","x":547,"y":978,"width":167,"height":37},{"text":"했다.","x":730,"y":977,"width":73,"height":38},{"text":"여기서는","x":821,"y":977,"width":136,"height":38},{"text":"인터넷에서","x":973,"y":976,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"공통적으로","x":1159,"y":979,"width":169,"height":37},{"text":"사용하는","x":1343,"y":978,"width":134,"height":37}]},{"text":"이런 것들과 다른 매체를 간단히 살펴본다.","words":[{"text":"이런","x":171,"y":1037,"width":63,"height":37},{"text":"것들과","x":249,"y":1037,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"다른","x":361,"y":1038,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"매체를","x":439,"y":1038,"width":100,"height":37},{"text":"간단히","x":552,"y":1038,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"살펴본다.","x":664,"y":1038,"width":143,"height":38}]},{"text":"물리 매체가 무엇을 의미하는지 정의하기 위해 비트에 대해 알아보자. 한 종단 시","words":[{"text":"물리","x":234,"y":1098,"width":62,"height":38},{"text":"매체가","x":315,"y":1098,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"무엇을","x":427,"y":1098,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"의미하는지","x":542,"y":1099,"width":164,"height":38},{"text":"정의하기","x":726,"y":1099,"width":129,"height":39},{"text":"위해","x":875,"y":1099,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"비트에","x":958,"y":1099,"width":100,"height":38},{"text":"대해","x":1077,"y":1099,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"알아보자.","x":1159,"y":1100,"width":142,"height":38},{"text":"한","x":1317,"y":1100,"width":34,"height":36},{"text":"종단","x":1363,"y":1099,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"시","x":1443,"y":1099,"width":28,"height":37}]},{"text":"스템에서 여러 링크와 라우터를 거쳐 다른 종단 시스템으로 한 비트가 전달되는 것을","words":[{"text":"스템에서","x":170,"y":1159,"width":127,"height":37},{"text":"여러","x":318,"y":1159,"width":61,"height":38},{"text":"링크와","x":400,"y":1159,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"라우터를","x":513,"y":1159,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"거